  "answer": "Project Zenith is a multi-phase initiative focused on data analytics, cloud storage optimization, and predictive analytics. Key milestones include:\n\n1. **Initiation**: Launched in Q3 2023 (kickoff dates mentioned as June 15th and July 15th in different communications) with an initial budget of $500,000 for Phase One. Leadership includes Sarah Tan, Marcus Cole, and others.\n2. **Team Expansion**: Five new members specializing in cybersecurity and cloud architecture joined the team in September.\n3. **Budget Approval**: A total budget of $2M was approved by the executive board to cover research, development, and marketing, with detailed allocations discussed in August. Additionally, $15,000 was approved for specialized training.\n4. **Progress**: The project has completed the design phase and testing phase. A breakthrough in predictive analytics was achieved in Phase Two.\n5. **Partnerships**: Discussions are underway with TechInnovate to leverage their AI technology.\n6. **Upcoming Events**: A staff meeting on November 20th will feature a detailed report on Phase Two progress. Celebrations for the testing milestone occurred on October 10th."
